	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『機動戦士ガンダム 鉄血のオルフェンズ』より、大型MS「グレイズ・アイン」が最速立体化！",
			"• 武器持ち手に加えてスクリューパンチの状態を再現した握り手や、ドリルキックを表現した脚部先端パーツが付属！■可動するバックパックにより、専用大型アックスを掴みとる大胆なアクションポーズをとらせることも可能！■左右肩部格納式機関銃は差し替え式で再現！"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"Mobile Suit Gundam Iron-Blooded Orphans\", the large MS \"Glaze Ein\" is the fastest to become three-dimensional!",
			"• In addition to the weapon handle, a grip hand that reproduces the state of a screw punch and leg end parts that represent a drill kick are included! ■With a movable backpack, it is also possible to make bold action poses where you can grab a special large axe! ■The left and right shoulder retractable machine guns are interchangeable and reproduced!"
		]
